# KIL6: the run-time descriptor

`preA q m W`: create the register file and compute `2^u`, `e = ⌈log_q 2^u⌉`, `q^e`,
`Kp = ⌈log_m e⌉`, `r = min (W·Kp) e`, `n = e - r`, `q^r`, `q^n`, `vol G · q^r` and the swap
registers.
